  "message": "The documented Silver Zoom Card information does not state its standard annual fee, so I can’t confirm whether it has one from the available terms.

The 3x cash-back offer is not described specifically as a new-card sign-up bonus. The terms say that eligible customers can claim and activate it through the account portal, and that the 3x earning period lasts 9 months from account opening. Claims are documented as eligible from January 1, 2024 through December 31, 2025, and the account must be open and in good standing. Because the terms do not clearly say that every newly opened personal Silver Zoom account automatically receives the offer, you should verify the offer appears in the promotional-offers section before relying on it.

The Silver Zoom Card does have a separate documented new-customer promotion: 0% APR on fuel purchases for the first year for accounts opened from September 15 through December 31, 2025, subject to approval and program rules."
}
